{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1205283-iselsi-character-ideas-in-a-db-game","id":1205283,"title":"Iselsi character ideas in a DB game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-10T10:34:24-07:00","id":1205283,"title":"Iselsi character ideas in a DB game","content":"The previews for the new DB book I think do a great job of laying out some possible Iselsi character ideas for a DB game (sleeper agent, char who decided to join the Order for whatever reason, member of the patsys who still use the House name).<br /> <br /> But I'm wondering if anyone here has played or come up with some fun Iselsi character ideas they'd like to share? It's a cool House but (obviously) out of the norm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4620-tumbleweed664","name":"tumbleweed664","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-10T10:53:48-07:00","id":1205291,"title":"","content":"Well, once played with a character who was an Iselsi without even knowing, being member of a Cadet House of convoluted story that served as a convenient front for a part of the family to return to dynastic society in a somewhat respectable manner.<br /> <br /> Now i'm toying with the idea of a young charismatic immaculate monk of heretic and cult-forming leanings, who might be either an Outcaste or a Iselsi scion faking it for the sake of his elders' agenda.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-10T11:25:01-07:00","id":1205308,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking of a character born into House V'neef, but whose mother is an adopted Patrician - whose bloodline in said Patrician House is actually Iselsi. He's now married into House Sesus, and so now is openly cultivating his V'neef connections, while behind closed doors betraying the House of his birth to prove himself to the Sesus spy hierarchy. His true loyalty though is too Iselsi, and everything he's doing against V'neef for Sesus is toward the end of climbing the Sesus spy hierarchy to serve Iselsi better from within.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-11T09:18:13-07:00","id":1205627,"title":"","content":"A particularly insane idea that crossed my mind is what if some very dedicated and skilled veteran Iselsi dedicated decades, if not centuries, of its existence to approaching the Empress, dominating her habits and routines to get ever closer to the ideal moment for an assassination - only to find herself lost with her sudden disappearance and to make the most of her painstakingly acquired knowledge, took her place as an impersonator. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}